  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokhu uAbisalomu wazidingela inqola yokulwa, lamabhiza, labantu abangamatshumi amahlanu ukuba bamkhaphe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbisalomu wayevuka ekuseni eme eceleni kwendlela eya esangweni lomuzi; kuthi wonke umuntu olecala eliya enkosini ukuba lithethwe, uAbisalomu ambize athi kuye: Ungowawuphi umuzi na? Kuthi lapho yena esithi: Inceku yakho ingowesinye sezizwe zakoIsrayeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uAbisalomu abesesithi kuye: Indaba yakho yinhle, ilungile, kodwa kakulamuntu obekwe yinkosi ukuba akuzwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbisalomu abesesithi: Kungathi ngabe ngibekwe umahluleli elizweni! Ng’khona bonke abaletha amacala lezindaba kimi bengizabalungisela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuthi lapho kusondela umuntu ukuba akhuleke kuye, elule isandla sakhe, ambambe, amange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbisalomu wenze njalo kubo bonke abakoIsrayeli abeza enkosini ngamacala; ngakho uAbisalomu wazithumba inhliziyo zabantu bakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi emva kweminyaka emine uAbisalomu wathi kuDavida: Ake ngiyegcwalisa isifungo sami engasifunga eNkosini uNkulunkulu eHebroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba mina nceku yakho ngafunga ngisahlala eGeshuri elaseAramu ngathi: Uba iNkosi uNkulunkulu ingibuyisela isibili eJerusalema, ngizakuyikhonza eHebroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDavida yathi kuye: Uhambe kuhle. UAbisalomu wasesuka esiya eHebroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasethuma izithunywa ezizweni zonke zakoIsrayeli esithi: Lapho lisizwa ukukhala kophondo, lithi: UAbisalomu uyinkosi eHebroni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwahamba loAbisalomu abantu abangamakhulu amabili abamenyiweyo besuka eJerusalema, bahamba bengesabi lutho, bengazi lutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbisalomu esanikela umhlatshelo wabiza uAhithofeli waseGilo, umeluleki kaDavida, emzini wakhe eGilo. Ukuhlamuka kwaqina, labantu banda njalo ngakuAbisalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekufika isithunywa kuDavida, sathi: Inhliziyo zabantu bakoIsrayeli sezibuyele ngakuAbisalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi uDavida encekwini zakhe zonke ezazilaye eJerusalema: Asibalekeni masinyane, ngoba uba singenzi njalo, kakuyikuphepha lamunye wethu kuAbisalomu. Phangisani, hlezi asifice asehlisele okubi, awuchithe umuzi ngomkhonto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zenkosi zathi kuyo: Thina silungele ukwenza loba kuyini inkosi ekubona kufanele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasiphuma inkosi, bayilandela bonke abendlu yayo. Inkosi yatshiya abanye abafazi bayo abalitshumi ukuba balinde indlu yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahambake inkosi, bonke abantu bayilandela; bafika bema endlini yokucina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zonke inceku zayo zema phansi kwayo; kwathi amaKerethi lamaPelethi ayengabalindi, loIthayi kanye labantu baseGiti abangamakhulu ayisithupha, badlula phambi kwenkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasisithi kuIthayi waseGiti: Uhambelani lathi na? Buyela uhlale lenkosi entsha, ngoba ungowezizweni lomxotshwa elizweni lakini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ufike izolo nje; pho, lamuhla uzazulazula lami na? Kangazi lapho ngiya khona. Buyela ekhaya, uhambe labakini; iNkosi uNkulunkulu ikunike uthando olungapheliyo leqiniso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uIthayi wayiphendula inkosi wathi: Ngifunga iNkosi uNkulunkulu, futhi ngifunga wena nkosi yami, kuleyondawo ezakuba kiyo inkosi yami, loba kusekufeni loba kusekuphileni, izakuba khona lapho lenceku yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesithi kuIthayi: Kulungile, dlulake, uhambe. Wasedlulake uIthayi waseGiti kanye labantu bakhe bonke labantwana ababelaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwe lonke laduma ngokukhala kwabo. Inkosi yasala imi lapho abantu bechapha isifula iKidroni ngaphambi kwayo, ngendlela eya ngasenkangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UZadoki laye wayekhona lawo wonke amaLevi; babethwele umtshokotsho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sikaNkulunkulu, bawubeka phansi eduze loAbiyatha baze baphuma bonke abantu emzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasisithi kuZadoki: Buyisela umtshokotsho kaNkulunkulu emzini. Uba ngifumene umusa emehlweni eNkosi, izangibuyisa ngiwubone wona kanye lendlu yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba isithi: Kangithokozi ngawe; nanku ngikhona, kayenze kimi ekubona kufanele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yaqhubeka yathi kuZadoki umpristi: Buyela emzini, wena loAbiyatha, uhambe lensizwa zombili, uAhimazi indodana yakho loJonathani indodana kaAbiyatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Minake ngizalinda ngasemazibukweni asenkangala, kuze kufike ilizwi elivela kini lokungibikela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke uZadoki loAbiyatha bawubuyisela umtshokotsho kaNkulunkulu eJerusalema, bahlala khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasekhwela intaba ethiwa yiOliveti, ehamba ekhala, embomboze ikhanda lakhe, engafakanga amanyathelo; bonke abantu ababelaye bambomboza amakhanda abo, bahamba bekhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabikwa kuDavida kwathiwa: UAhithofeli uphakathi kwabahlamuke loAbisalomu. UDavida wakhuleka wathi: Nkosi, ake uphendule amacebo kaAhithofeli abe yibuthutha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ukuba uDavida adundubale engqongeni yentaba lapho uNkulunkulu wayekhulekwa khona, wahlangabezwa nguHushayi waseArki umngane wakhe, ibhatshi lakhe lidatshuliwe, lekhanda lakhe ligcwele inhlabathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wathi kuye: Uba uhamba lami, uzakuba ngumthwalo kimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba ubuyela emzini uthi kuAbisalomu: Ngizakuba yinceku yakho, nkosi; kade ngiyinceku kayihlo, khathesi ngizakuba yinceku yakho; uzangichithela amacebo kaAhithofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuba khona kanye lawe abapristi uZadoki loAbiyatha; ubatshele konke okuzwayo endlini yenkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukhona lapho lamadodana abo amabili, uAhimazi indodana kaZadoki, loJonathani indodana kaAbiyatha; uzangitshela ngabo konke ozakukuzwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHushayi umngane kaDavida wafika emzini, uAbisalomu engena eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
